<h3>Version 1.0.6</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Deleting many files at once is now much faster — messages are removed in
      batches instead of one at a time.</li>
  <li>When something is refused, Finder no longer keeps a stale view of the folder.</li>
  <li>Lower memory use when working with large libraries.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
